  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ugboroke Progressive Fish Farmers Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project includes a capacity building component in which members would be trained on modern fish processing practices in addition to business management and organizational skills. The society will also establish a fish processing facility for the production of dry fish, produce and procure fresh fish for further processing into dry fish.</narrative>
  </description>
